cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, model or code, please cite it as below, and cite the 40 constituent experimental studies listed in data/processed/SOURCES.md. Those measurements are their authors' work; citing this compilation is not a substitute."
title: "Z-factor benchmark: 6726 experimental natural-gas compressibility factors with absolute inputs, and the NNCF neural surrogate"
abstract: >-
  An open benchmark of 6726 experimental gas-phase compressibility factors from
  40 published studies with absolute pressure, temperature and composition, and
  a residual neural surrogate distilled from AGA8-DETAIL that attains
  reference-equation accuracy on it without any laboratory measurement entering
  training.
type: dataset
authors:
